## Startup & temporary library

- Startup opens last chosen PureWriter folder; on failure falls back to **app-support temporary library** (`openDefaultLibrary`).
- `LibraryViewModel.needsLibrarySetup` is true until a user-chosen path is remembered → setup banner /「临时书库」.
- Never leave the UI blocked only by `StateError('No PureWriter library is open.')`; recover via default library or setup sheet.

## Mobile compact chrome

- Floating top bar: `WorkspaceMobileBookBar` in `workspace_sidebar.dart` (opaque surface, shadow, no border).
- Layout: menu (48→40) · left-aligned book name button · `more_vert` overflow.
- Book button → bottom sheet select/edit; More → `WorkspaceMobileTool` / `showWorkspaceMobileToolsSheet` (reserved API).
- Scroll hide/show: `_MobileEditorChrome` in `workspace_page.dart` — slop threshold then **independent** show/hide animation (no scroll-linked drag, no overshoot).
- Opening the swipe drawer dismisses the IME (`FocusManager.unfocus` in `zephyr_swipe_drawer.dart`).
- IME quick toolbar sits above the keyboard (`quick_toolbar/`); tools button hides IME and expands a fixed-height drawer; focusing the article auto-collapses the drawer.

## Paired punctuation wrap

- Domain: resolve/detect/remap/orphan in `paired_punctuation.dart`; tests in `tests/domain/paired_punctuation_test.dart`.
- Typing: IME client expands opener → full pair and pins caret between; short caret lock resists IME yanking to glyphs; redundant closer inserts skipped.
- Toolbar / editor: `_beginPairSession` in `workspace_editor.dart`; one-shot interior highlight via `TextSpanDecoration` (empty slot centered between opener/closer anchors).
- Exit when selection leaves the interior (after brief post-insert snap window); Enter exits after the closer; empty-open delete removes orphan closer.

## Jump-to-end chip

- Logic + chip UI in `workspace_editor.dart` (`_shouldOfferJumpToEnd`, l10n key `jumpToEnd` →「聚焦到文末」).
- Show on chapter open when end is off-screen (`ignoreCaret: true` — restored caret is often at EOF).
- Hide when scroll reaches end, or later when the user moves the caret to EOF / no text after selection.

## Sidebar chapter preview

- Sidebar reads `ArticleSummary.summary` (`workspace_sidebar.dart` chapter tile).
- Summary = first ~200 runes after newline normalize (`article_preview_summary.dart`); DB write in `saveArticle`.
- After debounced `LibraryViewModel.save()`, `_refreshSidebarPreviewIfNeeded` updates in-memory library summary when the leading preview text changed (no full `load()`).

## Undo selection

- `PlainTextEditingController.undo`/`redo` restore text with a **collapsed** caret (never re-select a prior range).
- `deleteBackward`/`deleteForward` must not expand selection before pushing undo (that used to snapshot a range).

## System bars (Android)

- Always edge-to-edge; nav/gesture bar **visible** with transparent background (app paints underneath).
- Do **not** use `SystemUiMode.immersiveSticky` (it hides the gesture bar). Hide-status-icons uses `SystemUiMode.manual` with only `SystemUiOverlay.bottom`.
- Native: `WindowCompat.setDecorFitsSystemWindows(false)`, `isNavigationBarContrastEnforced = false` in `MainActivity.kt`; theme styles set transparent status/nav + `enforceNavigationBarContrast` false (API 29+).

## Database pitfalls (Android)

- Native **sqflite allows one SQL statement per `execute`**. Schema must be `_schemaStatements` + `batch`, not a multi-statement string (FFI desktop hid this bug).
- Incomplete Zephyr DBs (fingerprint + missing `Article`) are repaired in `_ensureCompleteSchema`.
- Existing PureWriter libraries open as-is (no `onUpgrade`); stub `Room.db` may restore from `Backups/*.pwb`.

