## Wireless debug note

Wireless `adb` + Flutter VM Service port-forward is flaky (`127.0.0.1` connection refused). Prefer USB for hot reload; wireless is fine for smoke UI only.

`adb` lives at `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Android\Sdk\platform-tools`. Cursor terminals inherit PATH from when Cursor launched — fully restart Cursor after PATH changes, or rely on the PowerShell profile prepend for `platform-tools`.
